      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Tribeca , originally written as TriBeCa, is a neighborhood in Lower Manhattan, New York City. Its name is a syllabic abbreviation from \"Triangle Below Canal Street\". The \"triangle\", or more accurately, a trapezoid, is bounded by Canal Street, West Street, Broadway, and either Chambers, Vesey, or Murray Streets.",
